flowchart TD
    start([Define product purpose]) --> concept[Describe the problem, users and desired outcome]
%% @airflow-context concept
%% Store only the stable product rationale in `.air/concept.md`: the problem,
%% intended users, desired outcome, boundaries and success measures. Do not list
%% all features here or introduce technical implementation choices.
    concept --> conceptApproval{Product concept approved?}
    conceptApproval -- No: refine the problem or outcome --> concept
    conceptApproval -- Yes: save `.air/concept.md` --> conceptReady([Project concept established])
%% Obtain explicit human approval for the exact current file digest. Record the
%% decision evidence in `.air/index.md` according to the contract's Approval
%% evidence section. Revisit only when the product direction materially changes.
%% @end-airflow-context

    classDef boundary fill:#126a52,color:#ffffff,stroke:#126a52
    classDef approval fill:#fff0e8,color:#633b2c,stroke:#c68162
    class start,conceptReady boundary
    class conceptApproval approval